  "review_request_client": {
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Thank you for visiting Rahma Therapy</title>\n  </head>\n  <body style=\"margin:0;background:#f7f3ec;color:#1f2f2b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e8dfd2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px;\">\n        <p>Thank you for choosing Rahma Therapy for your hijama_back. We hope you felt looked after from start to finish.</p>\n      <p>If you have a moment, we&#039;d be grateful for an honest review on Google. It helps other people in Luton find us.</p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin-top:24px;font-weight:600;\">Here are a few example reviews if you'd like a starting point — or write your own, whatever feels honest:</p>\n      <ul style=\"padding-left:18px;\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">I had a brilliant home massage in Luton today — really professional setup, felt completely relaxed by the end.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Booked a home massage with Rahma Therapy in Luton. The therapist was excellent, the experience felt like a proper clinic but in the comfort of home.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Just had a fantastic massage at home in Luton. Highly skilled, deeply relaxing, and so easy not having to travel.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:24px 0;\">\n        <a href=\"https://g.page/r/Ccfwk27JycKDEBM/review\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0f5e8e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">\n          Leave a Google review\n        </a>\n      </p>\n\n      <p style=\"white-space:pre-line;\">Thank you again,\nThe Rahma Therapy team</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>",
    "text": "Thank you for choosing Rahma Therapy for your hijama_back. We hope you felt looked after from start to finish.\n\nIf you have a moment, we'd be grateful for an honest review on Google. It helps other people in Luton find us.\n\nHere are a few examples if you'd like a starting point, or write your own:\n- I had a brilliant home massage in Luton today — really professional setup, felt completely relaxed by the end.\n- Booked a home massage with Rahma Therapy in Luton. The therapist was excellent, the experience felt like a proper clinic but in the comfort of home.\n- Just had a fantastic massage at home in Luton. Highly skilled, deeply relaxing, and so easy not having to travel.\n\nLeave a Google review: https://g.page/r/Ccfwk27JycKDEBM/review\n\nThank you again,\nThe Rahma Therapy team\n"
